{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I've completed the technology review for this project, and there are several requirements the draft plan doesn't currently meet. Personal phones cannot be used for school recordings — the project must use district tablets instead. All files must be stored in the restricted OralHistory drive, not on personal devices or public servers. Recordings must be deleted exactly 45 days after the final class presentation — indefinite retention is not permitted. Finally, the technology plan must include a secure-storage configuration record documenting these arrangements."}
```

